      "description": "A wooden cross planted in grass, adorned with flowers and a rosary, serves as a memorial marker. In the background, a car is visible on a road, and text overlays the image. The scene implies a memorial for a driver, juxtaposed with the text 'a good asian driver', creating a harmful stereotype.",
